00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:13,130
X four is the Orthocenter of triangle A B C: the point of concurrence of the three altitudes A H sub a, B H sub b, and C H sub c, and the perspector of the orthic triangle H sub a, H sub b, H sub c.

2
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:21,877
Its trilinear coordinates are secant A, to secant B, to secant C, and its barycentric coordinates are tangent A, to tangent B, to tangent C.

3
00:00:21,877 --> 00:00:33,000
On the central lines layer, X four lies on the Euler line through X two, X three, and X five, the Orthocenter–Spieker line through X nine and X ten, and the Fuhrmann line through X eight.

4
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:44,755
X four is the isogonal conjugate and anticomplement of the Circumcenter X three, and the isotomic conjugate of the symmedian point of the anticomplementary triangle, X sixty-nine.

5
00:00:44,755 --> 00:00:51,340
On the right three-four-five triangle, all three altitudes concur directly at the right-angled vertex C.
